WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.423
Learn math by

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.543
dragging it around

00:00:03.078 --> 00:00:04.457
DragDropMath is a

00:00:04.269 --> 00:00:05.448
hands-on web app

00:00:05.283 --> 00:00:06.438
that teaches math

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:07.028
by feel

00:00:07.241 --> 00:00:08.243
letting you drag

00:00:08.102 --> 00:00:09.280
and drop expressions

00:00:09.092 --> 00:00:10.153
instead of typing

00:00:09.965 --> 00:00:11.002
out formulas

00:00:11.542 --> 00:00:12.532
The idea is

00:00:12.344 --> 00:00:13.440
to make algebra

00:00:13.252 --> 00:00:14.242
feel tangible

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:14.926
so you learn

00:00:14.738 --> 00:00:15.492
by moving the

00:00:15.304 --> 00:00:16.541
pieces around and

00:00:16.353 --> 00:00:17.567
seeing exactly what

00:00:17.379 --> 00:00:18.192
changes

00:00:18.710 --> 00:00:19.228
It is a

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:20.526
Show HN project

00:00:20.585 --> 00:00:21.540
built for learners

00:00:21.351 --> 00:00:22.495
who understand more

00:00:22.307 --> 00:00:23.084
by feel than

00:00:22.896 --> 00:00:23.804
by symbols on

00:00:23.616 --> 00:00:24.653
a printed page

00:00:25.182 --> 00:00:26.196
Full story on

00:00:26.007 --> 00:00:26.903
the dashboard
